#: apps/accounts/services.py:92
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Technician limit %(technician)s must stay strictly below the manager limit "
"%(manager)s, otherwise the interval the manager tier covers is empty and no "
"amount ever needs a manager approval. To remove the manager tier, delete the "
"manager limit - amounts above the technician limit then escalate straight to "
"the director. To remove the service's own self-approval authority, delete the"
" technician limit - every quote then needs an internal approval."
msgstr ""
"Limit tehničara %(technician)s mora ostati strogo ispod limita menadžera "
"%(manager)s, inače je opseg koji pokriva menadžerski nivo prazan i nijedan "
"iznos nikada ne traži odobrenje menadžera. Da biste uklonili menadžerski "
"nivo, obrišite limit menadžera - iznosi iznad limita tehničara tada idu pravo"
" direktoru. Da biste ukinuli samostalno odobravanje servisa, obrišite limit "
"tehničara - tada svaka ponuda traži interno odobrenje."

#: apps/accounts/services.py:105
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Manager limit %(manager)s must not exceed the director limit %(director)s - "
"the ladder has to rise with authority."
msgstr ""
"Limit menadžera %(manager)s ne smije biti veći od limita direktora "
"%(director)s - ljestvica mora rasti sa ovlašćenjem."

#: apps/accounts/services.py:117
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Technician limit %(technician)s must stay below the director limit "
"%(director)s: amounts the director rung is meant to catch would otherwise "
"proceed on the service's own authority with no internal approval at all."
msgstr ""
"Limit tehničara %(technician)s mora ostati ispod limita direktora "
"%(director)s: iznosi koje direktorska prečka treba da uhvati inače bi "
"prolazili na sopstvenu odgovornost servisa, bez ijednog internog odobrenja."

