#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/approval_limits.html:18
msgid ""
"These limits decide who has to approve a quote before work may start "
"(ACT-02). Amounts are in EUR; there is no currency choice, the whole "
"application is single-currency."
msgstr ""
"Ovi limiti određuju ko mora odobriti ponudu prije početka rada (ACT-02). "
"Iznosi su u EUR; izbor valute ne postoji, cijela aplikacija je jednovalutna."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/approval_limits.html:21
msgid ""
"Up to the technician limit the service decides on its own authority and only "
"the client's consent is needed; above it and up to the manager limit a "
"manager approval is required; above the manager limit a director approval is "
"required. The director amount is recorded for reference only - it is not read"
" as a ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Do limita tehničara servis odlučuje na sopstvenu odgovornost i potrebna je "
"samo saglasnost klijenta; iznad njega, a do limita menadžera, traži se "
"odobrenje menadžera; iznad limita menadžera traži se odobrenje direktora. "
"Iznos direktora se vodi samo radi evidencije - ne čita se kao gornja granica."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/approval_limits.html:24
msgid ""
"A missing limit escalates conservatively: with no technician limit nothing is"
" self-approvable, and with no manager limit every quote goes to the director."
msgstr ""
"Limit koji nedostaje eskalira konzervativno: bez limita tehničara ništa se ne"
" odobrava samostalno, a bez limita menadžera svaka ponuda ide direktoru."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/approval_limits.html:27
msgid ""
"Only the director may edit the approval limits: whoever can rewrite the "
"ladder can approve past it, so this is not a price list (ACT-02)."
msgstr ""
"Samo direktor smije mijenjati limite odobravanja: ko može prepisati "
"ljestvicu, može i odobriti mimo nje, pa ovo nije cjenovnik (ACT-02)."

