#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/approval_limits.html:93
msgid ""
"These limits sit on roles the approval ladder never consults (ACT-02 knows "
"only the technician, manager and director rungs), so they have no effect. "
"They are shown here so nothing is hidden; delete them when they are no longer"
" wanted."
msgstr ""
"Ovi limiti stoje na ulogama koje ljestvica odobravanja nikada ne konsultuje "
"(ACT-02 poznaje samo prečke tehničara, menadžera i direktora), pa nemaju "
"nikakvo dejstvo. Prikazani su da ništa ne bi bilo skriveno; obrišite ih kada "
"više nisu potrebni."

