msgstr "Već je na planu, na %(pos)s - naciljajte da ga premjestite"

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_layout.html:39
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Asset footprint: %(length)s m x %(width)s m. Aim at a spot in a yard below - "
"the outline marked #%(case)s follows the pointer and shows whether the spot "
"is legal before you commit."
msgstr ""
"Gabarit uređaja: %(length)s m x %(width)s m. Naciljajte mjesto u nekom od "
"skladišta ispod - obris označen sa #%(case)s prati pokazivač i pokazuje da li"
" je mjesto dozvoljeno prije nego što potvrdite."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_layout.html:72
msgid "Move asset"
msgstr "Premjesti uređaj"

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_layout.html:72
msgid "Place asset"
msgstr "Postavi uređaj"

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_layout.html:81
msgid ""
"The outline follows the pointer while it is over a yard, and stays where you "
"left it so you can reach the button - nothing is written until you press it. "
"Escape drops the aim. With the plan focused, the arrow keys nudge by one "
"metre (hold Shift for half) and Enter places."
msgstr ""
"Obris prati pokazivač dok je iznad dvorišta i ostaje gdje ste ga ostavili da "
"biste stigli do dugmeta - ništa se ne upisuje dok ga ne pritisnete. Escape "
"poništava nišan. Kada je plan fokusiran, strelice pomjeraju za jedan metar "
"(uz Shift za pola), a Enter postavlja."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_layout.html:84
