#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_zone_edit.html:21
msgid ""
"Enter the yard's width and length in metres and upload a photo or drawing of "
"it - an aerial view cropped to that rectangle works best. The picture is "
"stretched to those dimensions and shown under the plan, and assets are placed"
" over it. The picture is only a backdrop: the numbers are what the plan "
"measures."
msgstr ""
"Unesite širinu i dužinu skladišta u metrima i učitajte njegovu fotografiju "
"ili crtež — najbolje radi snimak iz vazduha isječen na taj pravougaonik. "
"Slika se razvlači na te dimenzije i prikazuje ispod plana, a uređaji se "
"smještaju preko nje. Slika je samo podloga: plan mjeri brojeve."

#: apps/backoffice/templates/backoffice/storage_zone_edit.html:31
