#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3234
msgid ""
"Amounts up to this limit proceed on the service's own authority - client "
"consent only, no internal approval is required."
msgstr ""
"Iznosi do ovog limita prolaze na sopstvenu odgovornost servisa - potrebna je "
"samo saglasnost klijenta, interno odobrenje nije potrebno."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3238
msgid ""
"Amounts above the technician limit and up to this one require a manager "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"Iznosi iznad limita tehničara, a do ovog limita, traže odobrenje menadžera."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3242
msgid ""
"Amounts above the manager limit require a director approval. This amount is "
"recorded for reference - it is not read as a ceiling, the director is the "
"last rung."
msgstr ""
"Iznosi iznad limita menadžera traže odobrenje direktora. Ovaj iznos se vodi "
"radi evidencije - ne čita se kao gornja granica, direktor je posljednja "
"prečka."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3331
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Role '%(role)s' may not change the approval limits: the ladder decides who "
"has to approve a quote, so only %(allowed)s may edit it (ACT-02)."
msgstr ""
"Uloga '%(role)s' ne smije mijenjati limite odobravanja: ljestvica određuje ko"
" mora odobriti ponudu, pa je smije mijenjati samo %(allowed)s (ACT-02)."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3346
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Quote #%(id)s needs no further approval under the new limits and has been "
"accepted."
msgstr ""
"Ponuda #%(id)s prema novim limitima ne zahtijeva dalje odobrenje i prihvaćena"
" je."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3363
#, python-format
msgid "Approval limit %(limit)s added."
msgstr "Limit odobravanja %(limit)s je dodat."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3383
#, python-format
msgid "Approval limit %(limit)s updated."
msgstr "Limit odobravanja %(limit)s je izmijenjen."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3403
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Approval limit %(limit)s deleted. Nothing escalates: the director is the last"
" rung and its amount was recorded for reference only, so quotes above the "
"manager limit still require a director approval."
msgstr ""
"Limit odobravanja %(limit)s je obrisan. Ništa se ne eskalira: direktor je "
"posljednja prečka, a njegov iznos se vodio samo radi evidencije, pa ponude "
"iznad limita menadžera i dalje traže odobrenje direktora."

#: apps/backoffice/views.py:3409
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Approval limit %(limit)s deleted; amounts in that range now escalate to the "
"next level up."
msgstr ""
"Limit odobravanja %(limit)s je obrisan; iznosi iz tog opsega sada idu na "
"sljedeći viši nivo."

